#: templates/index.htm:262
msgid "ManuSpectrum was developed within Cluster 2 — \\"
msgstr "ManuSpectrum was developed within Cluster 2 — \\"

#: templates/index.htm:265
msgid ""
"Through structuring and standardizing data according to shared models, the "
"project provides reliable, easy-to-use tools accessible to non-specialists. "
"Built on Arches, an open-source platform for heritage data management, "
"ManuSpectrum facilitates data access and collaboration between researchers "
"from different disciplines."
msgstr ""
"Through structuring and standardizing data according to shared models, the "
"project provides reliable, easy-to-use tools accessible to non-specialists. "
"Built on Arches, an open-source platform for heritage data management, "
"ManuSpectrum facilitates data access and collaboration between researchers "
"from different disciplines."

#: templates/index.htm:268
msgid ""
"The model focuses on identifying the component as a pivot axis between the "
"object, its context, the analyses, and their interpretations, using thesauri"
" and authority databases to contextualize information on heterogeneous "
"documents."
msgstr ""
"The model focuses on identifying the component as a pivot axis between the "
"object, its context, the analyses, and their interpretations, using thesauri"
" and authority databases to contextualize information on heterogeneous "
"documents."

#: templates/index.htm:276 templates/views/pages/contact.htm:123
#: templates/views/pages/team.htm:145
msgid "Biblissima+ — Cluster 2"
msgstr "Biblissima+ — Cluster 2"

#: templates/index.htm:278
msgid ""
"ManuSpectrum is part of the Biblissima+ programme, an observatory of ancient"
" written cultures. Within Cluster 2, the objective is to archive, share and "
"enable searching of materials analysis data from the community, ensuring "
"interoperability with the Biblissima portal and written cultural heritage "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"ManuSpectrum is part of the Biblissima+ programme, an observatory of ancient"
" written cultures. Within Cluster 2, the objective is to archive, share and "
"enable searching of materials analysis data from the community, ensuring "
"interoperability with the Biblissima portal and written cultural heritage "
"standards."

