#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:5
#| msgid ""
#| "The ManuSpectrum data model: an event-centric CIDOC-CRM / CRMsci description"
#| " of manuscripts, analyses and inferred knowledge."
msgid ""
"The ManuSpectrum data model: an event-centric CIDOC-CRM / CRMsci description"
" of written cultural heritage, the analyses applied to it and the knowledge "
"inferred from them."
msgstr ""
"The ManuSpectrum data model: an event-centric CIDOC-CRM / CRMsci description"
" of written cultural heritage, the analyses applied to it and the knowledge "
"inferred from them."

#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:10
msgid "A model for describing written heritage scientifically"
msgstr "A model for describing written heritage scientifically"

#: templates/views/pages/conceptual-model.htm:16
#| msgid ""
#| "Most heritage databases record what a manuscript <em>is</em>. ManuSpectrum "
#| "records what <em>happened to it</em> — and who said so. Every measurement is"
#| " an event with a date, an instrument and an operator. Every interpretation "
#| "is stored separately from the observation that supports it. That separation "
#| "is what lets you re-read someone else's conclusion — and disagree with it."
msgid ""
"Most heritage databases record what an object <em>is</em>. ManuSpectrum "
"records what <em>happened to it</em> — and who said so. Every measurement is"
" an event with a date, an instrument and an operator. Every interpretation "
"is stored separately from the observation that supports it. That separation "
"is what lets you re-read someone else's conclusion — and disagree with it."
msgstr ""
"Most heritage databases record what an object <em>is</em>. ManuSpectrum "
"records what <em>happened to it</em> — and who said so. Every measurement is"
" an event with a date, an instrument and an operator. Every interpretation "
"is stored separately from the observation that supports it. That separation "
"is what lets you re-read someone else's conclusion — and disagree with it."

